aces significant  budget deficits of its own indeed it  looks like it's going to have to pay  upwards of fifty billion dollars from  its own reserve funds just to balance  the budget in 2015 so Russia doesn't  have any money really to spare for  Greece all the money has to go to  support the Russian economy which as I  mentioned earlier is in very difficult  circumstances
 

